encies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.7 RC1\n\n### System information\n\nMacOS X Tahoe 26.5.1 - Godot 4.7 RC1\n\n### Issue description\n\nIt appears that the function to import Blender files by dragging them into scene nodes has stopped working in Godot 4.7 RC1. However, it is still possible to import Blender files by using the instantiate function\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new scene with Node3D  as its root\n2. drag Blender file from the file system tree to the node\n3. Godot will change the mouse pointer to a symbol that indicates that it is impossible to execute the function and refuses to import the Blender object as child of the node\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[cantdrag.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28773408/cantdrag.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"weiju","id":25801,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25801?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/weiju","html_url":"https://github.com/weiju","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weiju/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weiju/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weiju/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weiju/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weiju/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weiju/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weiju/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weiju/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weiju/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120123/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com